# #228: normal-mode arrows against their atoms' spheres, calc-water-vib.
# Modes are 0-based: 0 bend 1645, 1 sym. stretch 3866, 2 asym. stretch 3965.
# nmcheck writes, per atom, the arrow tip's distance from the atom centre and
# where a ray along the arrow meets the atom's sphere.
viewall
nmvect 1
nmcheck nm1-default
snap nm1-default
nmvect 2
nmcheck nm2-default
snap nm2-default
style Ball And Stick
nmvect 1
nmcheck nm1-ballstick
snap nm1-ballstick
nmvect 2
nmcheck nm2-ballstick
snap nm2-ballstick
